{
  "id": "E272",
  "title": "Staying Up Shopping on Double Eleven",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-11-10",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming’s parents are staying up late. What are they doing?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/898/09c858300cbabe8f1f2ffd0e562bdb587be8cbfb.mp3?1540867664",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你还不睡觉吗？\n\n爸爸：都十一点半了，你还不睡觉吗？\n妈妈：你忘了？明天双十一！\n爸爸：双十一是什么？\n妈妈：就是11月11号的网上购物节，在网上买东西很便宜。\n爸爸：真的吗？多便宜？我也看看。\n妈妈：你快看看吧，12点我就下单。错过就得等明年了。",
    "traditional": "你還不睡覺嗎？\n\n爸爸：都十一點半了，你還不睡覺嗎？\n媽媽：你忘了？明天雙十一！\n爸爸：雙十一是什麼？\n媽媽：就是11月11號的網上購物節，在網上買東西很便宜。\n爸爸：真的嗎？多便宜？我也看看。\n媽媽：你快看看吧，12點我就下單。錯過就得等明年了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Are You Not Going To Sleep Yet?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "爸爸：都十一点半了，你还不睡觉吗？",
      "traditional": "爸爸：都十一點半了，你還不睡覺嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bà ba dōu shí yī diǎn bàn le nǐ hái bú shuì jiào ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dad: It’s already 11:30 pm. Are you not going to sleep yet?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "妈妈：你忘了？明天双十一！",
      "traditional": "媽媽：你忘了？明天雙十一！",
      "pinyin": "mā ma nǐ wàng le míng tiān shuāng shí yī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Did you forget? Tomorrow is double eleven!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "爸爸：双十一是什么？",
      "traditional": "爸爸：雙十一是什麼？",
      "pinyin": "bà ba shuāng shí yī shì shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dad: What is double eleven?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "妈妈：就是11月11号的网上购物节，在网上买东西很便宜。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：就是11月11號的網上購物節，在網上買東西很便宜。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma jiù shì 2 yuè 2 hào de wǎng shang gòu wù jié zài wǎng shang mǎi dōng xi hěn pián yi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: It’s November 11th, the online shopping festival. It will be really cheap to buy things online."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "爸爸：真的吗？多便宜？我也看看。",
      "traditional": "爸爸：真的嗎？多便宜？我也看看。",
      "pinyin": "bà ba zhēn de ma duō pián yi wǒ yě kàn kan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Dad: Is that so? How cheap? Let me see."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "妈妈：你快看看吧，12点我就下单。错过就得等明年了。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：你快看看吧，12點我就下單。錯過就得等明年了。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma nǐ kuài kàn kan ba 2 diǎn wǒ jiù xià dān cuò guò jiù děi děng míng nián le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Quickly, take a look! I place the orders at 12 o’clock. If you miss it you’ll have to wait another year."
    }
  ],
